tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/ba069dfdd5cf24ae5c70a86104da1f0d.poster.avif?t=1753805007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/ba069dfdd5cf24ae5c70a86104da1f0d.webm?t=1753805007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/ba069dfdd5cf24ae5c70a86104da1f0d.mp4?t=1753805007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the complex but intuitive tactical RPG combat and plan your actions thoroughly in accordance with your playstyle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/c049d073dd66881178a666cae14cb4a6.poster.avif?t=1753805007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/c049d073dd66881178a666cae14cb4a6.webm?t=1753805007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/c049d073dd66881178a666cae14cb4a6.mp4?t=1753805007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
